  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Bring a large saucepan of salted water to the boil.\n• Peel potato and cut into large chunks.\n• Cook potato in the boiling water until easily pierced with a fork, 12-15 minutes.\n• Drain potato, then return to the pan. Add the butter and milk, then season generously with salt. Mash until smooth.\n• TIP: Save time and get more fibre by leaving the potato unpeeled!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/683fbff742dc4b92819a784b/step-08136600.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the potato is cooking, finely chop brown onion and celery.\n• Grate carrot.\n• Finely chop garlic.\n• Tear kale leaves from the stem, then roughly chop the leaves.\n• Pick and finely chop rosemary leaves.\n• Pick thyme leaves.\n• Drain and rinse lentils.\n• TIP: Run your fingers down the rosemary stalk to remove the leaves easily.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/683fbff742dc4b92819a784b/step-e47dbc10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook onion, celery and carrot, stirring, until softened, 5-6 minutes.\n• Add garlic, rosemary, thyme, tomato paste and another drizzle of olive oil. Cook until fragrant, 2-3 minutes.\n• TIP: Feel free to use less rosemary if you find it has a strong flavour.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/683fbff742dc4b92819a784b/step-b7abe620.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Stir through lentils, diced tomatoes with garlic & onion, the brown sugar, stock concentrate and a splash of water. Simmer until mixture is slightly reduced, 5-7 minutes.\n• Stir through kale until softened, 1-2 minutes.\n• Season with salt and pepper to taste.\n• TIP: Add another splash of water to loosen the filling, if needed.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/683fbff742dc4b92819a784b/step-df598b30.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Preheat grill to high.\n• Transfer lentil filling to a baking dish. Top with potato topping, spreading it out evenly.\n• Sprinkle with Cheddar cheese.\n• Grill pie, until cheese is melted, 8-10 minutes.\n• TIP: Grills cook fast, so keep an eye on the pie!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/683fbff742dc4b92819a784b/step-565cfb40.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Divide hearty lentil and veggie shepherd’s pie between plates to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/683fbff742dc4b92819a784b/step-51aa0050.jpg"
    }
  ]
